<title>USA: BTG says it, Unisys get contract.</title>
<headline>BTG says it, Unisys get contract.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said Tuesday it is a subcontractor for a Unisys Corp team for an omnibus contract awarded by the National Institutes of Health.</p>
<p>The company said Unisys estimates the team's potential revenue from the contract is $100 million over the contract's five-year term.</p>
<p>The company said during the contract term the Unisys team competes against other selected contractors for NIH projects such as systems integration and telecommuting services.</p>
<p>BTG provides information and technology services and products to government and commercial clients.</p>
</text>
